// LSP 入口的当前源版本缓存（分析生命周期与缓存设计 §五）。按真实文本命中，仍由驱动逐次发现和读取文件。
import { parseSourceBin } from "../parser";
import { txImports } from "../semamirror";

struct SourceEntry {
    path: string, text: string, raw: string, bin: string, imports: string, epoch: int,
}

export struct SourceCache {
    entries: List<Ref<SourceEntry>>, epoch: int, parsed: int, decoded: int,
}

export function sourceCacheNew(): Ref<SourceCache> {
    return new SourceCache { entries: listNew(), epoch: 0, parsed: 0, decoded: 0 };
}

export function sourceCacheBegin(c: Ref<SourceCache>): void {
    if (c.epoch == 9223372036854775807) {
        c.epoch = 0;
        for (e in c.entries) { e.epoch = -1; }
    } else { c.epoch = c.epoch + 1; }
    c.parsed = 0; c.decoded = 0;
}

export function sourceCacheFinish(c: Ref<SourceCache>): void {
    const keep: List<Ref<SourceEntry>> = listNew();
    for (e in c.entries) { if (e.epoch == c.epoch) { listPush(keep, e); } }
    c.entries = keep;
}

export function sourceParse(c: Ref<SourceCache>?, path: string, text: string): string {
    if (c == None) { return parseSourceBin(text); }
    const cache = c catch sourceCacheNew();
    for (e in cache.entries) {
        if (e.path != path) { continue; }
        e.epoch = cache.epoch;
        if (e.text != text) {
            e.text = text; e.raw = parseSourceBin(text); e.bin = ""; e.imports = "";
            cache.parsed = cache.parsed + 1;
        }
        return e.raw;
    }
    const raw = parseSourceBin(text);
    cache.parsed = cache.parsed + 1;
    listPush(cache.entries, new SourceEntry { path: path, text: text, raw: raw, bin: "", imports: "", epoch: cache.epoch });
    return raw;
}

export function sourceImports(c: Ref<SourceCache>?, path: string, bin: string): string {
    if (c != None) {
        const cache = c catch sourceCacheNew();
        for (e in cache.entries) {
            if (e.path == path) {
                if (e.bin != bin || len(e.imports) == 0) {
                    e.bin = bin; e.imports = txImports(bin); cache.decoded = cache.decoded + 1;
                }
                return e.imports;
            }
        }
        cache.decoded = cache.decoded + 1;
    }
    return txImports(bin);
}
